  "worked_solution": "Note that if we shift the graph $2$ units left or right, the graph remains unchanged.\n\nOn the other hand, if we shift the graph horizontally by any distance other than $2$ (or a multiple of $2$), we get a different graph.\n\nTherefore, the period of the function is $2.$",
